Package: parkeze-cellular
Depends: modemmanager, kmod-usb-net-qmi-wwan, ucode, curl
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: Cellular backhaul management and data frugality.
 Brings up the modem, and keeps the gateway's own traffic on the metered link
 to the minimum that still allows it to be managed.
